Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 15:19:04 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Advance transaction history durably in bounded chunks and
 resume pool staging

Maintenance explanation added during mailbox export:
Advance history with durable bounded block transitions using the active height index, removing the total ancestry length ceiling on initial catchup. Resume staged pool reconstruction across ticks and classify local wire limits as capacity refusals, with regressions for durable chunks and one-validation budgets.

